<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Illinois Tool upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Illinois Tool upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Chicago Corp analyst Robert McCarthy said he upgraded Illinois Tool Works Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>--Shares in the components and engineered systems manufacturer on Thursday closed up 1-1/2 to 72-7/8 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>--&quot;ITW can outperform the market over the coming 12 months,&quot; McCarthy said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
